      "title": "The Last Drop Is Ours",
      "text": "We share water with any thirsty stranger; {name:water_thief_chief} has taken that for weakness. Strike the {name:thieves_camp}, {dir_from_giver:thieves_camp}, and kill six Water Thieves and their chief. They guard their stolen water day and night. Let Sunscar fill its cups without looking over its shoulder.",
      "completion": "Lastdrop has had his last drop, and our wells belong again to the hands that tend them. Sunscar will tell this one loudly, and for once the boasting is earned. Take the road when you are ready; your cup stays full here.",
